    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44115" root="&#xA;                        نقل&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَنْقُولُ</span></b> 
                         [<i>Discerned</i> knowledge; opposed to
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْقُولُ</span>]: under this term are comprised the
sciences of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُصُولُ الدِّينِ</span> (also called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِلْمُ الكام</span>).
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَدِيثُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفِقْهُ</span>: all the other sciences are
comprised under the term <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَعْقُولُ</span>; (IbrD;) i. e.
<i>intellectual,</i> or <i>perceived by the intellect;</i> and
<i>excogitated.</i>
